    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aXiuzhenWorld2\u300bis a 3D world where your goal is to level up from a mere mortal into an immortal at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its a semi-idle game with fun immortal cultivation mechanics such as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- leveling up to become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- capturing monsters as pets to fight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- killing monsters &amp; comparing the stats of different equipment loot you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- over 10 different combat skills which get unlocked as you level up to kill monsters even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- upgrading your weapons to become more powerful with currency you collect from monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- opening treasure chests which drop from monsters, these treasure chests provide random drops, see how lucky you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Reincarnation to come back stronger with better base stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game comes with a built-in AFK(Away From Keybourd) function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player communication group:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Group:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Telegram Group:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explain:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This new game series is not a completely new game, but an upgrade and reconstruction of the previous generation of games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an independent game, and the author's abilities, energy, and funds are limited. The new game is not for shell swapping to make money:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. We need funding to support research and development, and we cannot spend many years polishing it to perfection before releasing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. The new game will invest a lot of time and effort in refactoring, enriching content, and increasing gameplay. Although not all of them may bring positive reviews, the author's intention is definitely to make the game better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Although the mainstream gameplay of the new game has not changed much on the surface, the internal logic and data structure have been restructured. This restructuring is destructive to the game's data archives. If you have to constantly iterate on a game, you really don't have the energy to repair the player's data archives frequently. What's more, frequent modifications can bring a bad experience to players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. The author is not a professional in the gaming industry, and game development is just a hobby with insufficient experience, resulting in flaws in all aspects of the game. However, the author hopes to continuously refine and create an interesting game that brings joy to players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Regarding price: The new version uses bundled packages to encourage old players to purchase at a lower price. The total price of the bundled package will only be slightly higher than the unit price of the new game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Thank you to the old players, because of your support, the game can continue to develop and iterate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Welcome everyone to give a&lt;real&gt;review of the game. Positive reviews are the driving force, while negative reviews can make the game progress.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aXiuzhenWorld2\u300bis a 3D world where your goal is to level up from a mere mortal into an immortal at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its a semi-idle game with fun immortal cultivation mechanics such as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- leveling up to become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- capturing monsters as pets to fight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- killing monsters &amp; comparing the stats of different equipment loot you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- over 10 different combat skills which get unlocked as you level up to kill monsters even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- upgrading your weapons to become more powerful with currency you collect from monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- opening treasure chests which drop from monsters, these treasure chests provide random drops, see how lucky you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Reincarnation to come back stronger with better base stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game comes with a built-in AFK(Away From Keybourd) function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player communication group:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Group:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Telegram Group:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explain:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This new game series is not a completely new game, but an upgrade and reconstruction of the previous generation of games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an independent game, and the author's abilities, energy, and funds are limited. The new game is not for shell swapping to make money:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. We need funding to support research and development, and we cannot spend many years polishing it to perfection before releasing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. The new game will invest a lot of time and effort in refactoring, enriching content, and increasing gameplay. Although not all of them may bring positive reviews, the author's intention is definitely to make the game better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Although the mainstream gameplay of the new game has not changed much on the surface, the internal logic and data structure have been restructured. This restructuring is destructive to the game's data archives. If you have to constantly iterate on a game, you really don't have the energy to repair the player's data archives frequently. What's more, frequent modifications can bring a bad experience to players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. The author is not a professional in the gaming industry, and game development is just a hobby with insufficient experience, resulting in flaws in all aspects of the game. However, the author hopes to continuously refine and create an interesting game that brings joy to players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Regarding price: The new version uses bundled packages to encourage old players to purchase at a lower price. The total price of the bundled package will only be slightly higher than the unit price of the new game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Thank you to the old players, because of your support, the game can continue to develop and iterate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Welcome everyone to give a&lt;real&gt;review of the game. Positive reviews are the driving force, while negative reviews can make the game progress.</p>",
    "short_description": "\u300aXiuzhenWorld2\u300bis a 3D world where your goal is to level up from a mere mortal into an immortal at the end. Its a semi-idle game with fun immortal cultivation mechanics such as - leveling up to become stronger. - capturing monsters as pets to fight for you. - AFK(Away From Keybourd).",
